# === Content pages — CDN edge caching, instant browser freshness (Task 48) ===
# Browsers revalidate on every visit (max-age=0); Cloudflare edge caches 24h
# (purged automatically on every deploy) to protect the origin under crawl
# load; stale-while-revalidate capped at 5 minutes — NEVER raise it again:
# a 604800 (7-day) SWR window made third-party examiners and AdSense
# reviewers see week-old builds after fixes shipped (2026-10-31 incident).
#
# Includes both the main page AND sub-routes (wildcard *)

