# === Dynamic sub-route pages — CDN caching (CRITICAL for crawl performance) ===
# These wildcard rules cover the 50 state pages, salary pages, blog posts, etc.
# Without s-maxage, every sub-page request hits the origin → Connection Timeout
# under crawl load. s-maxage alone carries that protection — browsers still
# revalidate every visit (max-age=0).

/sales-tax-calculator/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, s-maxage=86400, stale-while-revalidate=300

